Task: standard
Section: user
Description: standard system utilities
 A curated set of command-line utilities that Athena installs by
 default.  Derivative of Debian's "standard" task but uses an
 explicit Key: list (Athena-chosen) rather than the broad
 "Packages: standard" Priority sigil.  Operator who wants any
 Debian-standard package not listed here can apt-install
 individually post-install — they're all available in /cdrom/pool.
Key:
 bash-completion
 bzip2
 ca-certificates
 dnsutils
 file
 gettext-base
 groff-base
 iputils-ping
 less
 lsof
 man-db
 manpages
 media-types
 openssh-client
 pciutils
 psmisc
 rsync
 systemd-timesyncd
 tcpdump
 ucf
 usbutils
 vim
 wget
 xz-utils
